# Issue tracker

The `engineering-loop` skill and the board skill read this file at Intent,
Spec and Land. Issue states, categories, sizes and board columns are the
pack's; this file holds only this project's facts. Replace each prompt; keep
the headings.

## Repo

The GitHub repository that holds this project's issues, specs and PRs
(`<owner>/{{ project_name }}`), and whether it is public or private.

## Components

Where a change lands. One bullet per component, `name`: what it covers. Every
issue carries at least one.

## Never on GitHub

What must never appear in an issue, comment, commit message or PR, such as
customer data, credentials or private figures, and what to write instead.
"None" is an answer.

## Extra labels

Labels this project adds beyond the pack's, and what each means. "None" is an
answer.

## Extra categories

Labels that count as an issue's category beyond the method's four, and what
each means. "None" is an answer.
